    "SHEET CANCELED",
    "Solenoid & carburetor adjustment, preconditions: engine running; choke and fast idle fully off; A/C compressor on.",
    "1) Set throttle by hand to 1000 RPM using the tachometer. 2) Fit the energized solenoid loosely in the bracket, slide it up until the plunger just touches the throttle lever extension [8], then tighten clamp bolt [5] to torque. 3) Recheck idle (1000 RPM); if off, adjust the plunger hex nut (A)."
